      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Unrihthæmde mæn to rihtum life mid synna hreowe tofon oþþe of ciricean ge[m]a[n]an ascadene sien.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Men in an unlawful union shall take up a just life with repentance of sins, or be separated from the community of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Unrihthæmde mæn to rihtum life mid synna hreowe tofon oþþe of ciricean genaman ascadene sien.</ab>
